{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And HaShem said</b>, etc., <b>is heavy</b>, etc. One needs to know what Elohim informs by this matter, since they already know Him. Or perhaps it is because there was no reply from Pharaoh to Moses about not sending them — rather, he saw the sign and fell silent, and HaShem informed Moses what this silence was: that his heart was heavy and he refused to send the people, and he did not bother to give a reply denying the matter."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:25:29.272223264Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}